          "id": "f231d3791049f4967fc441937f2247a2bbd243b6",
          "message": "feat: Add embeddings to `mock_items` table (#5665)\n\n# Ticket(s) Closed\n\n- Closes #\n\n## What\n\nAdd a hard coding embedding field to `mock_items`, to be used in\nupcoming docs. Because some tests rely on the old schema, also create a\n`mock_items_no_embedding` table for tests.\n\n## Why\n\n## How\n\n## Tests",
