          "message": "fix: Disallow multi-valued fields in `partition_by` or `sort_by`. (#5712)\n\n## What\n\nDisallow multi-valued columns in `partition_by` or `sort_by`.\n\n## Why\n\nPartitioning and sorting are undefined in the presence of multi-valued\ncolumns.\n\n## Tests\n\nNew regress tests.",
