          "id": "b48b0e124067dabc03073b4818e724a337840e91",
          "message": "chore: Dedupe propagation of `partition_by` in the aggregate scan (#5928)\n\n## What\n\nPropagate `partition_by` during aggregate scan planning, and expand the\ntypes handled in `ScalarValue`/`PdbOwnedValue` conversion.\n\n## Why\n\nTo allow the aggregate scan to be range co-partitioned, and to reduce\nduplication of conversion functions.\n\n## Tests\n\nNew regress test showing a range co-partitioned aggregate.",
