          "id": "99ff7e89f8e5f7a0f61bcf07586fda576ecc939b",
          "message": "fix: Render metrics in aggregatescan `EXPLAIN ANALYZE`. (#5610)\n\n## What\n\nAdd DataFusion metrics for the `aggregatescan`, and fix redundant\nrendering of the plan under `EXPLAIN ANALYZE`. Unify `DataFusion` plan\nrendering across the `aggregatescan` and `joinscan`.\n\n## Why\n\nTo remove redundancy, and expose more metrics (including runtimes) under\n`EXPLAIN ANALYZE`.\n\n## Tests\n\nNew regress test shows `EXPLAIN ANALYZE` metrics for the\n`aggregatescan`.",
