          "message": "test: dst feature lowers to debug_assert (#5680)\n\nThis PR modifies the dst feature in stressgres and pg_search to lower\nconditional DST assertions to debug_asserts when compiled with\ndebug_assertions enabled.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
