          "message": "feat: eagerly abort index build if it will not fit on disk (#5535)\n\n# Ticket(s) Closed\n\n- Closes #\n\n## What\n\nDuring index build, coordinate among workers how many more segments will\nbe produced, and eagerly abort if we estimate that these segments will\noccupy more than remaining available disk space.\n\n## Why\n\n## How\n\n## Tests\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: paradedb-github-app[bot] <282009505+paradedb-github-app[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
