          "message": "fix: Error if Tantivy truncates results (#5571)\n\n# Ticket(s) Closed\n\n- Closes #\n\n## What\n\nWe use cardinality estimates to route queries to Tantivy vs Datafusion,\nbut those estimates can be stale. If a query incorrectly gets routed to\nTantivy, we should error instead of silently truncating.\n\n## Why\n\n## How\n\n## Tests",
