          "message": "fix: ignore ProbeStats returned by vector collector (#5719)\n\n# Ticket(s) Closed\n\n- Closes #\n\n## What\n\nRemoves the GUC which enabled a notice that logged vector search\nstatistics\n\n## Why\n\nThis is being replaced with stats that are emitted via `EXPLAIN ANALYZE\nVERBOSE`\n\n## How\n\n## Tests\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: paradedb-github-app[bot] <282009505+paradedb-github-app[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
