          "message": "feat: Fix missed timestamp-rewriting sites and add `time`/`timetz` support (#5350)\n\n# Ticket(s) Closed\n\n- Closes #5340\n\n## What\n- Add support for time/timetz fields to tantivy-style queries.\n- Add timestamp rewriting to 2 other tantivy parsing sites that was\nmissed on the prior pass.\n\n## Why\nCompleteness. We already support the other datetime types, and\nsupporting these is easy.",
