          "message": "fix: Fix panic in index expressions on JSON (#5645)\n\n## What\n\nIndexing expressions on JSON projections were panicking at `CREATE\nINDEX` time due to overly aggressive stripping of casts.\n\n## Why\n\nIn order to support `ORDER BY` on JSON fields.\n\nBecause of the dynamic typing involved in #1917 (to determine the type\nof the JSON column at runtime), it will always be a tiny bit slower and\nquite a bit more error prone than an index expression.\n\n## Tests\n\nAdd a new regress test covering an `ORDER BY` on an JSON indexing\nexpression.",
