          "id": "3e72702bea8671148cbd4552a8948ce805f3b898",
          "message": "fix: pdb.fuzzy rhs under generic prepared plans on === (#5799)\n\nIn search_with_term_support exec_rewrite, the RHS type check only\naccepted text/text[], so `field === $1::pdb.fuzzy(...)` errored under\ngeneric prepared plans with \"must be a text or text array value\"\n(pg_search/src/api/operator.rs:992, build_text_funcexpr). Recognize the\npdb.query castable set (pdb.query, pdb.fuzzy, pdb.boost, pdb.slop,\npdb.const) and route through a new\nparadedb.term_search_query_input(fieldname, pdb.query) that mirrors the\nconst path: classify UnclassifiedString/Array into term/term_set,\nre-apply fuzzy/slop. cargo pgrx regress pg18: 315 passed, 0 failed.\ncargo fmt and cargo doc (warnings as errors) both clean.\n\nFixes #5779",
