          "id": "2a91ac37588f7e2c9b31fa769a766178b541da5b",
          "message": "chore: Add range co-partitioned join benchmarks (#5929)\n\n# Ticket(s) Closed\n\n- Closes #5734\n\n## What\n\nAdds range co-partitioned join benchmarks.\n\n## Why\n\n\nhttps://github.com/paradedb/paradedb/issues/5734#issuecomment-5277553981\nshowed that we will not be sure how widely we can enable range\nco-partitioning of joins until M2.\n\nAdding benchmarks variants for range co-partitioning will help make it\nclearer when and where we are ready to enable it.\n\n## How\n\nAdd the `paradedb.enable_range_partitioned_join` GUC to control whether\nrange co-partitioning is used.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Mohammad Dashti <mdashti@gmail.com>",
