          "message": "fix: gate the aggregate custom scan on partial-index predicates (#5518)\n\n# Ticket(s) Closed\n\n- Closes #\n\n## What\n\nThe aggregate custom scan was executing even if it was a partial index\nand the query did not contain the partial index predicate.\n\n## Why\n\n## How\n\n## Tests",
