          "id": "66a44236b323aade968fd52a45e092709b03b9d4",
          "message": "feat(mpp): enabled MPP plan partitioning by default. (#5430)\n\n## What\n\nThis PR enables MPP plan partitioning by default.\n\n## Why\n\nMPP has lived behind `paradedb.enable_mpp`, off by default. With it on,\nJoinScan and AggregateScan hash-partition each table by the join key and\nshuffle intermediate rows between workers, so every row is scanned once.\n\n## How\n\n`paradedb.enable_mpp` now defaults to `true`. Turn it off to fall back\nto the non-MPP path.\n\n## Tests\n\nExisting tests.",
