          "message": "test: use DST wording in comments (#5759)\n\n## Summary\n\nUse DST terminology in non-harness comments that previously mentioned\nAntithesis directly.\n\n## Details\n\n- Rename the root `dst` profile comment to describe it as a DST build\nprofile.\n- Update pg_search correctness annotations from `[antithesis\ncorrectness]` to `[dst correctness]`.\n- Make Stressgres recovery-liveness source comments provider-neutral.\n- Leave the actual Antithesis dependency and provider-specific\nharness/workflow files untouched.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Pre-commit hooks passed during commit, including `clippy` and `cargo\ncheck`.",
