          "message": "feat: add `paradedb` as index access method name (#5609)\n\n# Ticket(s) Closed\n\n- Closes #\n\n## What\n\nIntroduce a `paradedb` index access method as the primary name, sharing\nthe existing `bm25_handler`. The `bm25` access method is retained as a\nbackwards-compatible alias, so `USING bm25` continues to work unchanged.\n\n## Why\n\n## How\n\n## Tests",
