          "message": "fix: Encode/decode dynamic filters during dispatch encode/decode so that dynamic filters survive across fragments (#5766)\n\n## What\nThis PR fixes the performance regression show in the `join_semi_filter`\nalternatives 1 and 4 benchmark that was introduced by #5634.\n\n## How\nDuring dispatch encoding and decoding, use the provided proto converter\nto encode/decode the dynamic filters.\n\n## Tests\nThe benchmark run in this PR shows the 50% perf improvement for the 2\n`join_semi_filter` benchmarks.",
