          "message": "refactor: rename `create_bm25_test_table` to `create_paradedb_test_table` (#5903)\n\n`paradedb.create_bm25_test_table` predates the access method rename to\n`paradedb` and is one of the last user-facing identifiers still carrying\nthe old brand. Renames it to `create_paradedb_test_table` and drops the\nold name in the `0.25.1 → 0.25.2` migration; hard rename with no\ncompatibility shim, and the `'bm25_test_table'` default `table_name` is\nuntouched.",
