          "id": "1ed55953be0f4b3b511b42c1821d32ff909da892",
          "message": "feat: expose index build time via index_created_at() (#5465)\n\n## What\n\nStores the wall-clock time a `bm25` index is built and exposes it\nthrough a new UDF, `paradedb.index_created_at(regclass)`.\n\n```sql\nSELECT paradedb.index_created_at('my_idx');\n--        index_created_at\n-- ------------------------------\n--  2026-07-02 14:31:07.442218+00\n```\n\nReturns `NULL` for indexes built before this change.",
