          "id": "459252e7ff140b9d3384674fea60be6192ec07d5",
          "message": "feat: emit segment info in EXPLAIN ANALYZE VERBOSE (#5726)\n\nEach SegmentCollector in Tantivy can return additional information about\nthe inner workings of the collector. For vectors this is the ProbeStats\nwhich are metrics about how the vector search was executed. For ParadeDB\nwe want to display these metrics when the query is ran with EXPLAIN\nANALYZE VERBOSE.\n\n# Ticket(s) Closed\n\n- Closes #\n\n## What\n\n## Why\n\n## How\n\n## Tests\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Walter Woodall <wwoodal@paradedb.com>\nCo-authored-by: paradedb-github-app[bot] <282009505+paradedb-github-app[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
