          "id": "3e803a4f87bbcbdfb87190e920766a03d3c0464b",
          "message": "fix: Fix dropped `pdb.agg` filters and improve warnings (#5846)\n\n# Ticket(s) Closed\n\n- Closes #5051\n\n## What\n\nIn some cases, `window_agg` planning would force quals to `Qual::All`,\ndespite there being predicates which could not be pushed down: this\nresulted in incorrect results (see #5051.) In those cases, a heap filter\nshould be used instead.\n\nAdditionally, in cases where we failed to execute the custom scan in the\npresence of a `window_agg`, error messages were not specific.\n\n## Why\n\nTo correctly apply heap filters when they have been extracted, and to\nmake error cases easier to debug.\n\n## Tests\n\nExpanded regress tests.",
