          "id": "f5fd37ae6888376a58de915fa790be9b8b52d491",
          "message": "chore: Remove unused deferred column state (#5576)\n\n## What\n\nRemove state `2` (fully materialized strings/bytes) from the UnionArray\nwhich is used to represent deferred columns.\n\n## Why\n\nIt has not been used in a long time (possibly ever). Our scan will only\never produce states `0` (`DocAddress`) or `1` (`SegmentOrdinal` +\n`TermOrdinal`), because pre/dynamic filtering translates filters into a\n`TermOrdinal` in order to apply them: it will not fully decode strings\nbefore emitting them.\n\n## Tests\n\nUnchanged. Some minor statistics changes in plans due to a smaller\nunion.",
