          "message": "docs: correct fuzzy and phrase errors, MLT namespace, stale GUC defaults and a broken anchor (#5814)\n\nDocs/code mismatches from an audit: fuzzy edit distance ops, phrase\noperand order, `more_like_this` is in `pdb` not `paradedb`, and a broken\n`#self-hosted` anchor.\nPlus stale off-by-default claims for `enable_join_custom_scan`,\n`enable_aggregate_custom_scan` and `enable_columnar_exec`, all on since\n#5286. No behaviour change.",
