          "id": "d98f76abc6ab96c1939bbd6b19f796d292a19c33",
          "message": "chore: add actionlint pre-commit hook (#6050)\n\nAdds the official actionlint v1.7.12 pre-commit hook. Embedded\nShellCheck is disabled because the repository already has a pinned\nstandalone ShellCheck hook.\n\nPins actions/create-github-app-token to v3.2.0 so actionlint reads the\ncurrent client-id metadata without suppressions. The actionlint\nconfiguration only declares the repository’s RunsOn custom runner-label\npatterns.\n\nAlso updates shellcheck-py to its latest tag, v0.11.0.1-1.\n\nValidation: actionlint and ShellCheck pass across the repository.",
