          "id": "132c865434ae74ae33dd05529ce2b032715ac176",
          "message": "perf: cache multi-buffer reads (#5697)\n\nFor multi-buffer reads we did not leverage the local LRU cache in\nLinkedBytesList. This meant every buffers was read from postgres and\ncopied. This change places all buffers into the cache for maximum\nefficiency. One drawback of an LRU cache is its not scan resistant.\nHowever when analyzing the callers of the read_bytes code it appeared\nnone of them should run into this issue.",
