          "message": "ci: (vector) Sweep query params to get recall/latency curves (#5724)\n\n# Ticket(s) Closed\n\n- Closes #\n\n## What\n\nRather than fixing a single tuning point for the vector indexes, sweep a\nrange of params and report the latency numbers that exceed 90, 95, and\n99 percent recall.\n\n## Why\n\n## How\n\n## Tests",
