          "message": "chore: upgrade sqlx to 0.9 and pgvector to 0.4.2 (#5803)\n\nUpgrading `pgvector`, which we now use, required upgrading `sqlx` as\nwell. This PR fixes some missing use of a username when using `sqlx`,\nwhich no longer works on `sqlx 0.9.0`.\n\nThis is part of an effort to upgrade a variety of our dependencies\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Philippe Noël <21990816+philippemnoel@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: paradedb-github-app[bot] <282009505+paradedb-github-app[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
