          "message": "chore: Update to pull-based df-d branch. (#5863)\n\n## What\n\nIncorporate https://github.com/paradedb/datafusion-distributed/pull/62\nto move our `WorkerChannel` from push based to pull based (RPC).\n\n## Why\n\nAlthough it does not result in a drop in total lines of code, moving to\na pull-based model (where the data for a stage/task/partition is only\nsent in response to a request) better aligns with how the canonical\n`df-d` implementation does things. It also eases the implementation of\nhttps://github.com/paradedb/paradedb/pull/5809.\n\n## Tests\n\nExisting tests.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: paradedb-github-app[bot] <282009505+paradedb-github-app[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
