          "message": "feat: Add `paradedb.vector_clusters` for cluster size/radius distributions (#5960)\n\n## What\n\nWe are interested in measuring per index cluster distributions, which\nrequires segments emitting their per-cluster posting-list sizes and\nball-bound radii to be aggregated by our benchmarking tool.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: paradedb-github-app[bot] <282009505+paradedb-github-app[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
