          "message": "chore: Dedupe the Postgres install in CI, and apply best practices (#6163)\n\n## What\n\nDedupe the Postgres install in CI, and add retries and best-practice\nkeyring setup.\n\n## Why\n\n\nhttps://github.com/paradedb/paradedb-enterprise/actions/runs/33415552097/job/99565208259\nwas failing due to a race caused by restarting daemons during an APT\ninstall. Rather than waiting, retries allow us to optimistically\ncomplete more quickly.",
